{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b19ab8d3da300ebacee47b3a61898377c939a862df73c671d6366b594aa904b0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:763046c3d99c3f7cd993b6e7c51feb991631605846a33375262d8ac2920d12c3",
      "text": "辛苦啦～！\n咦？恭二君你们怎么看起来没什么精神？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13e8bcfcba87747a393b2833ca7088f6781a59ad1eab61b9c1a679746959e4f1",
      "text": "啊，其实是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c13b44a5c77f41db1d912a496ed219f437d1858cd360e9b5038b297b6e811a3d",
      "text": "店内广播？\n什么嘛，就这点事啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:624ba1171cf71c87e58af6cd7fa8fe74ae041ccbaf030005ec0e397e0bdb58bb",
      "text": "既然这样，那就由我们来教你们吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16b09beac21ed6d2e3ad5d9ff0974ff5edb9dd1af0b1733941489d242b3541b8",
      "text": "因为我当过声优，\n如果是简单的事情应该能教教你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b9d6fc016fcb8e295d02022a5db08f638a9201719af261341f2772a8b474ae0",
      "text": "もふもふえん要教我们吗？太棒了！\n这样的话，工作一定会大成功的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39c02fcd3c339525213f576ecb369409c3573d0ee635ea0d3c373e9ee78fa7e9",
      "text": "是啊。能有这么强力的帮手来真是帮大忙了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d16e68003bba44383754bffc765113f2235e63a57cd3710fc129e1cb196ad02",
      "text": "诶、嘿嘿……\n为了能帮上忙，我会努力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85bea8f002fa58e21554f123d06d420bcc388a9a2f180c415be83e09181e4ce6",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n我们的日程怎么样～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7154e10ee6124d54bcee59333b57700e11cb7a88c2c4fc554c38bd0d4d98e0a8",
      "text": "もふもふえん的各位，\n在录音当天也是有空的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb4c9fa01d379151591fa4c33a6c18f2d2d40d95ad8f1024d3796a644bcafc9",
      "text": "太好啦！那当天就由我们来\n狠狠地特训你们吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000173:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000181:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5e0a2602585aaedbb82c88e09911e0aee61a3d155c263d368380f4527cd9220",
      "text": "……喂。是●●●●プロデューサー吗？\n是我，翼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000183:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c05e9c4605cd1a3400b1e83d959bf39d9f1924caddf4bc9c01ba8e865b23c04",
      "text": "突然打电话过来，不好意思。\n听说Beit的各位要担任一日店长……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000185:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f17d4293814b0706b2717709bb9b3a7971a73df30ff1966dfd7c72ca941f7166",
      "text": "还要做店内广播对吧？\n呜呜，肯定会很紧张吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000187:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c5e949b90f27f236d8c43370668aed8c75f3a90ad02d1caa7aa2419690f06ef",
      "text": "我当飞行员候补生的时候，\n也练习过广播呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000189:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5042e366cbf23a5646eb4433b287c67e50a1a52a49047ce84bfffa6ba60399c",
      "text": "当时都做过些什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000191:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:498d7e1cf0c3c07d8ca7e129cc365f332bf0e2123e5856cafa92ddcf648c5679",
      "text": "让我想想，比如说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000193:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:334a7b4305e40b8f8752ad8fd3c88138e890c82a4a4e1b947e7ab3b4997783c5",
      "text": "会根据目的地不同，\n对广播的内容做一些调整。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000195:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a79fd1297773dcea0c01cb876859403e12a9657deedb3b26fb5fcbde878e985",
      "text": "听说聊一聊当地的特产或观光景点，\n乘客们也会很高兴……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000197:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:322c66231c7107e2f2c3d376f33abc79cf5ad50075066a2f73d9698ad44f722c",
      "text": "所以练习的时候\n也会特别注意这些方面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000199:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68792294133bc3db0a08b98d47bad38db9ede008c8679371ba2db961f51ff992",
      "text": "Beit的店内广播\n会是什么样的内容，真令人期待呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000201:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d81db960fcb3fb284b06170dcd61eb68b54d6d78a6900158820e93e4730706d",
      "text": "我也会去听的。\n那么先挂了，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
